cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "A First-Moment-Constrained Rayleigh Problem on the Half-Line"
message: >-
  If you use this formalization or its accompanying manuscript, please cite it.
  The Lean 4 formalization and the proofs in the accompanying manuscript were
  produced with help from gpt-5.6-sol on high reasoning effort. The author
  verified all the results reported and takes full responsibility for the
  content.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-26
authors:
  - family-names: Marchini
    given-names: Davide
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0004-7808-2162"
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 formalization of the first-moment-constrained Rayleigh problem on
  the half-line, including the explicit compactly supported optimizer,
  discrete convergence results, qualified probability extensions, and
  certified numerical bounds.
